<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Validate Credit Card</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>Validate Credit Card</h2>

    <input id="card" placeholder="Enter 16 digit card number">
    <button onclick="checkCard()">Check</button>

    <p id="result"></p>

    <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
//JS
function checkCard() {
    let card = document.getElementById("card").value;

    let result = /^\d{16}$/.test(card);

    document.getElementById("result").innerHTML = result;
}
//SELF
^       → boshidan
\d      → raqam
{16}    → aynan 16 ta
$       → oxirigacha
.test() → tekshiradi
1234567890123456 → true
123456789012     → false
123456789012345a → false
Qisqasi: ^\d{16}$ → faqat 16 ta raqam bo‘lishi kerak.
